OL,3,GNEWSAMidwives concerned over possible
OL,4,Ababy unit closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Midwives (RCM)
OL,7,Fsaid it was concerned by reports that
OL,8,Ftwo maternity units could close.
OL,10,FNorfolk has maternity units at
OL,11,Fhospitals in Norwich, Gorleston and
OL,12,FKing's Lynn, with the latter two also
OL,13,Fserving Cambridgeshire and Suffolk.
OL,15,FThe trade union posted on Facebook that
OL,16,Flocal maternity services should be
OL,17,Finvested in rather than cut.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
