OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMidwives concerned over possible
OL,4,Ababy unit closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,7,FHospitals Group (NWUHG) has set out its
OL,8,F"Case for Change" on how services could
OL,9,Fbe delivered in future, but stressed
OL,10,Fthat no decisions had been made and no
OL,11,Fconsultation had begun. NHS leaders
OL,12,Fsaid any move to concentrate services
OL,13,Fat one or two sites would be based on
OL,14,Fproviding safer care for women and
OL,15,Fbabies.
